        "content": [
         {
          "text": "For this feature, API-A LITE must be refactored to return the error report in addition to standard Web error codes.  Provisions for API-A and API-M should also be made.  In addition, errors should be logged when desired by the repository administrator based on adminstrator logger settings.",
