         {
          "text": "Logged In: YES ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "user_id=189298",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Originator: NO",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "SCOPE REDUCTION:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Running content model validation as part of the reporting is no longer part of this feature.  It has been moved to [ 1824805 ] CMDA On-line Error Description (Part 2)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "REQUIREMENTS:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "a) When BMech is missing, the dissemination fails with a 404 and a note indicating which BMech is missing.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "b) When CModel is missing, the dissemination fails with a 404 and a note indicating which CModel is missing.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "c) When a bound datastream is missing, the dissemination fails with a 404 and a note indicating which datastream(s).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
