       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/91ba3ae46b5ff6357fbe55622c5d3f9a?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDD-4.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Daniel Davis",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A19472d6c-63f5-479e-9de0-57b80681cff8",
      "timeZone": "America/New_York"
     },
     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: fcswa<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=1855086<br/>\nOriginator: YES</p>\n\n<p>For this feature, API-A LITE must be refactored to return the error report in addition to standard Web error codes.  Provisions for API-A and API-M should also be made.  In addition, errors should be logged when desired by the repository administrator based on adminstrator logger settings.</p>",
     "created": "18/Sep/07 4:14 PM",
