     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: cwilper<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=189298<br/>\nOriginator: NO</p>\n\n<p>SCOPE REDUCTION:<br/>\nRunning content model validation as part of the reporting is no longer part of this feature.  It has been moved to [ 1824805 ] CMDA On-line Error Description (Part 2)</p>\n\n<p>REQUIREMENTS:<br/>\na) When BMech is missing, the dissemination fails with a 404 and a note indicating which BMech is missing.<br/>\nb) When CModel is missing, the dissemination fails with a 404 and a note indicating which CModel is missing.<br/>\nc) When a bound datastream is missing, the dissemination fails with a 404 and a note indicating which datastream(s).</p>",
     "created": "02/Nov/07 4:13 PM",
